# Utility Scripts Placement

All utility scripts, build scripts, and automation scripts should be placed in the [run-scripts/](mdc:run-scripts/) folder.

This includes:
- Compilation scripts (like [compile.sh](mdc:run-scripts/compile.sh))
- Distribution scripts (like [distribute.sh](mdc:run-scripts/distribute.sh))
- Build automation scripts
- Deployment scripts
- Any other utility scripts that help with project management

The `run-scripts/` folder is already set up in this project and contains existing scripts. When creating new utility scripts, always place them in this directory to maintain project organization.